OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying unsettled, with rain bands
OL,7,Fgradually drifting southeast through
OL,8,Fthe week. Brighter spells and showers
OL,9,Ffollow, heaviest in the north. Often
OL,10,Fbreezy, especially near coasts.
OL,11,FTemperatures generally near average.
